title: Install HyperGSD
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

Drag-and-drop the main ''HyperGSD plugin'' to your wiki to install:

<$let qualified-state=<<qualify "$:/state/plugin">> default-popup-state="yes">
{{$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd||$:/core/ui/Components/plugin-info}}
</$let>

If you are coming from GSD5, please also drag-and-drop to import the [[Migrating from GSD5 to HyperGSD]] tiddler and follow the instructions listed there.

!! Sub-plugins

The following ''sub-plugins'' require the main plugin to be installed.
They provide more helpful ways to track things you need to do and manage associated information:

<$set name="qualified-state" value=<<qualify "$:/state/plugin">>>
{{$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd-contacts||$:/core/ui/Components/plugin-info}}
{{$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd-contexts||$:/core/ui/Components/plugin-info}}
{{$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd-priorities||$:/core/ui/Components/plugin-info}}
{{$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd-references||$:/core/ui/Components/plugin-info}}
{{$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd-ticklers||$:/core/ui/Components/plugin-info}}
</$set>